chapter.v:
	And you 

	 have forgotten the exhortation which speaks to you as to sons:“My son, do not despise the chastening of the Lord,Nor be discouraged when you are rebuked by Him;
 [1 John 1:2; 3:8]

	looking carefully 

	 lest anyone fall short of the grace of God; lest any root of bitterness springing up cause trouble, and by this many become defiled;
 [Matt. 5:21;]
